# Netlify routing.
#
# The API runs as ONE serverless function (netlify/functions/api.mjs).
# /api/* requests are internally rewritten to that function (200 rewrite
# keeps method + body). Everything else is served as a static file or falls
# back to index.html for client-side routes.
/api/*  /.netlify/functions/api  200
/*      /index.html              200